  "notes": "USAGE:\n{持続|じぞく} emphasizes maintaining something over time. It is used both as a noun and as a suru verb. The compound {持続|じぞく}{可能|かのう} (\"sustainable\") has become very common in discussions of environmental and social policy.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {持続|じぞく}{可能|かのう}: sustainable\n- {持続|じぞく}{力|りょく}: endurance, staying power\n- {持続|じぞく}{的|てき}: continuous, sustained\n- {効果|こうか}が{持続|じぞく}する: the effect lasts\n- {成長|せいちょう}を{持続|じぞく}する: to sustain growth",
